            "summary": "i recently participated at a workshop with jens burger (www.jensburger.de) and the talent alina (alina). it was a very fun and amazing experience to&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>i recently participated at a workshop with jens burger (<a href=\"http://www.jensburger.de\">www.jensburger.de</a>) and the talent alina (alina). it was a very fun and amazing experience to shoot in this gorgeous location with such professional people.</p>\n<p>set 1</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6884.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1493\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6884-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"597\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6903.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1920\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6903-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6908.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1279\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6908-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6977_02.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1279\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF6977_02-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n<p>set 2</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7015.jpg\" data-size=\"1920x1280\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/52/gallery/DSCF7015-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\">