            "id": "https://www.ciclista.de/tenebrism/",
            "url": "https://www.ciclista.de/tenebrism/",
            "title": "tenebrism",
            "summary": "from Italian tenebroso (\"dark, gloomy, mysterious\"), also occasionally called dramatic illumination, is a style of painting using especially pronounced chiaroscuro, where there are violent&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<blockquote>\n<p>from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Italian_language\" title=\"Italian language\">Italian</a> <i><i lang=\"ang\"><a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tenebroso#Old_English\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikt:tenebroso\">tenebroso</a></i></i> (\"dark, gloomy, mysterious\"), also occasionally called dramatic illumination, is a style of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Painting\" title=\"Painting\">painting</a> using especially pronounced <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiaroscuro\" title=\"Chiaroscuro\">chiaroscuro</a>, where there are violent contrasts of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Light\" title=\"Light\">light</a> and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\">dark</a>, and where darkness becomes a dominating feature of the image. The technique was developed to add drama to an image through a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spotlight_(theatre_lighting)\" title=\"Spotlight (theatre lighting)\">spotlight</a> effect. [from wikipedia]</p>\n</blockquote>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/20240602_0178-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"5990\" height=\"3993\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0178-2-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0178-2-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0178-2-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0178-2-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/20240602_0184.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"5289\" height=\"3526\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0184-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0184-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0184-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0184-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/20240602_0239.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"6056\" height=\"4037\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0239-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0239-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0239-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0239-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/20240602_0271.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"5487\" height=\"3658\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0271-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0271-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0271-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0271-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/20240602_0300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"5970\" height=\"3980\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0300-xs.jpg 300w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0300-sm.jpg 480w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0300-md.jpg 768w ,https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/responsive/20240602_0300-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/28/20240602_0310.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4159\" height=\"4159\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://www.ciclista.de/media/posts/